# CMS22 Blood Pressure Screening and Follow-Up
library "cms22".

// The unsuffixed file is the Quality Measure interface layer
// (IP / Denom / Numerator / Exclusions / Exceptions — what the Measure
// evaluation engine consumes). Asserted concepts, inferred derivations,
// and terminology live in cms22-asserted.crl / cms22-inferred.crl /
// cms22-concepts.crl.

// ============ Measure API ============

concept "Initial Population":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- defined as "cms22-Inferred"."Aged 18+ at Measurement Period Start".

concept "Denominator":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- defined as "Initial Population".

concept "Denominator Exclusions":
- type is Observation.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- defined as "cms22-Inferred"."Verified Hypertension As Of Qualifying Encounter".

concept "Numerator":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- defined as
(
   "cms22-Inferred"."Normal BP Reading"
   or
   "cms22-Inferred"."Elevated BP With Followup"
   or
   "cms22-Inferred"."First HTN With Followup"
   or
   "cms22-Inferred"."Second HTN 130s With Followup"
   or
   "cms22-Inferred"."Second HTN 140+ With Followup"
).

// #189 KNOWN-WRONG PENDING SLICE 2: this define still emits the pre-#189 squat miscompile —
// `exists(<total scalar boolean>) or exists(<total scalar boolean>)`, i.e. constant-true — because
// BOTH operands emit total scalar booleans (`HTN Followup Declined By Patient` was flipped to a real
// boolean disjunction in Slice-1 increment 5; `BP Measurement Not Done With Reason` is a §4 record
// composition that is NOT yet a provably-total boolean). It is deliberately LEFT `sem-or` here: flipping
// to `or` now would trip the boolean-composition operand-totality gate on the un-migrated §4 operand.
// Slice 2 migrates the §4 `BP Measurement …` chain and THEN flips this root `sem-or` → `or`. Tracked: #189.
concept "Denominator Exceptions":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- defined as
(
   "cms22-Inferred"."BP Measurement Not Done With Reason"
   sem-or
   "cms22-Inferred"."HTN Followup Declined By Patient"
).
